verb attack_timer_clears "Stinger charges Link is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 150
  take timer_attack
  unless phase_attack

verb inactive_timer_clears "Stinger swims off after a charge is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 290
  take timer_inactive
  unless phase_inactive

verb beached_timer_clears "Stinger flops out of the water, spines out is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 360
